<title>NETHERLANDS: GOUDA VUURVAST 1996 NET PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>GOUDA VUURVAST 1996 NET PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gouda Vuurvast NV said on Tuesday it expected a 1996 net profit of about 8.1 million guilders.</p>
<p>&quot;This result exceeds the expectation which was given when the half-year figures were announced,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>In 1995 the company posted a net profit of 5.4 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31  20 504 5000</p>
